sherpa-onnx-gplfree-0586cd8e14.aar is the Android library of sherpa-onnx,
built from source by Transly. Source: the head of k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx pull
request 4055 (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/4055), commit
0586cd8e14d7eae56e52ae0f1fd7b947e74b84f7 of
https://github.com/csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx. This change removes espeak-ng
(GPL-3.0-or-later) and piper-phonemize from sherpa-onnx, so the library
contains no espeak-ng code. Transly did not change the source. The build
script is scripts/sherpa-onnx/build-gplfree-aar.sh in the Transly app
repository. The ONNX Runtime library inside the AAR is the prebuilt
Android build that the sherpa-onnx build script downloads:
https://github.com/csukuangfj/onnxruntime-libs/releases/tag/v1.28.2

